      "message": "I think a less invasive way would be set chosen_non_negative_adj right here:\n\nif (points \u003c oc-\u003echosen_points) {\n  if (task-\u003esignal-\u003eoom_score_adj \u003e\u003d 0 \u0026\u0026 points \u003e oc-\u003echosen_non_negative_adj_points) {\n    if (oc-\u003echosen_non_negative_adj)\n      put_task_struct(oc-\u003echosen_non_negative_adj);\n    get_task_struct(task);\n    oc-\u003echosen_non_negative_adj \u003d task;\n    oc-\u003echosen_non_negative_adj_points \u003d points;\n  }\n  goto next;\n}\n\nthen you don\u0027t need the rest of the changes in this function.",
